title: $:/mf/gen/Panel/log panel
catalog: Panel
target: log panel
summary: The log panel type

!! Commands

* ``log:descend`` — Log: go into the selected label
* ``log:find`` — Log: jump to a label by number or name
* ``log:first`` — Log: move the selection to the newest row
* ``log:last`` — Log: move the selection to the oldest row
* ``log:next`` — Log: move the selection down
* ``log:parent`` — Log: back out to the level above
* ``log:prev`` — Log: move the selection up
* ``log:prune`` — Log: prune history before the selected label or operation
* ``log:refresh`` — Log: refresh from the daemon
* ``log:revert`` — Log: revert what is selected, or a narrower or wider scope
* ``log:toggle`` — Log: toggle a view flag (the watcher’s work)
